## 3. Parameters

### 3.1 Inherited from RowExpandFeature

All parameters from `RowExpandFeature<TGridItem>` are inherited.

### 3.2 Form-Specific Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `FormTemplate` | `RenderFragment<FormRowContext<TGridItem>>?` | null | Form layout (overrides `ExpandedTemplate`) |
| `UseDataAnnotations` | `bool` | `true` | Enable DataAnnotations validation |
| `ValidateOnChange` | `bool` | `true` | Validate on input vs only on save |

### 3.3 Save/Cancel Events

| Parameter | Type | Description |
|-----------|------|-------------|
| `OnSaveAsync` | `Func<TGridItem, Task<(bool Success, string? Error)>>?` | Custom save handler |
| `OnSaved` | `EventCallback<FormSaveEventArgs<TGridItem>>` | After successful save |
| `OnCancelled` | `EventCallback<FormCancelEventArgs<TGridItem>>` | After cancel |

