## 5. State Management

### 5.1 FormDraftManager

Tracks draft values separate from the original item:

```csharp
internal class FormDraftManager<TGridItem> where TGridItem : class
{
    // Store drafts per item, per property
    private readonly ConditionalWeakTable<TGridItem, Dictionary<string, object?>> _drafts;
    
    public TValue GetDraft<TValue>(TGridItem item, string propertyName, TValue originalValue);
    public void SetDraft<TValue>(TGridItem item, string propertyName, TValue value);
    public bool IsDirty(TGridItem item, string propertyName);
    public void CommitDrafts(TGridItem item);  // Write to item
    public void DiscardDrafts(TGridItem item); // Revert
}
```

### 5.2 FormValidationManager

Tracks validation state per field:

```csharp
internal class FormValidationManager<TGridItem> where TGridItem : class
{
    private readonly ConditionalWeakTable<TGridItem, Dictionary<string, List<string>>> _errors;
    
    public async Task ValidateFieldAsync<TValue>(
        TGridItem item, 
        string propertyName, 
        TValue value,
        IEnumerable<IValidator<TValue>>? validators,
        IEnumerable<ValidationAttribute>? annotations);
    
    public IReadOnlyList<string> GetErrors(TGridItem item, string propertyName);
    public bool HasErrors(TGridItem item);
    public void ClearErrors(TGridItem item);
}
```

