## 6. Form Components

### 6.1 FormField Auto-Wiring

`FormField<TGridItem, TValue>` automatically handles:

| Concern | Auto-Wired Behavior |
|---------|---------------------|
| **Label** | Extracts from property name or `[Display(Name="...")]` |
| **Input Type** | Infers from property type (string→text, DateTime→date, bool→checkbox) |
| **Draft Binding** | Binds to `FormRowContext.GetDraft()` / `SetDraft()` |
| **Validation** | Discovers DataAnnotations attributes |
| **Error Display** | Renders validation messages from context |
| **Dirty Tracking** | Visual indicator when field is modified |

### 6.2 FormField Parameters

```csharp
[CascadingParameter] public FormRowContext<TGridItem> Context { get; set; }
[Parameter, EditorRequired] public Expression<Func<TGridItem, TValue>> Property { get; set; }
[Parameter] public string? Label { get; set; }  // Override auto-detected
[Parameter] public string? Placeholder { get; set; }
[Parameter] public string? InputType { get; set; }  // Override auto-detected
[Parameter] public bool ReadOnly { get; set; }
[Parameter] public IEnumerable<IValidator<TValue>>? Validators { get; set; }
[Parameter] public RenderFragment<FormFieldContext<TValue>>? InputTemplate { get; set; }
```

