## 7. Rendering Override

FormRowFeature overrides the base expanded rendering:

```csharp
protected override void RenderExpandedMode(
    RenderTreeBuilder builder,
    ref int seq,
    TGridItem item,
    RowExpandedContext<TGridItem> baseContext)
{
    // Create enhanced form context
    var formContext = new FormRowContext<TGridItem>
    {
        Item = item,
        CollapseAsync = baseContext.CollapseAsync,
        SaveAsync = () => SaveAsync(item),
        CancelAsync = () => CancelAsync(item),
        // ... wire up draft/validation managers
    };
    
    // Cascade form context
    builder.OpenComponent<CascadingValue<FormRowContext<TGridItem>>>(seq++);
    builder.AddComponentParameter(seq++, "Value", formContext);
    builder.AddComponentParameter(seq++, "ChildContent", FormTemplate!(formContext));
    builder.CloseComponent();
}
```

