## 9. DataAnnotations Integration

When `UseDataAnnotations = true`, FormField discovers and applies validation attributes:

```csharp
public class Employee
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    
    [Required]
    [StringLength(50, MinimumLength = 2)]
    public string FirstName { get; set; } = "";
    
    [Required]
    [EmailAddress]
    public string Email { get; set; } = "";
    
    [Range(30000, 500000)]
    public decimal Salary { get; set; }
}
```

These are automatically validated on blur/change based on `ValidateOnChange` setting.

